# E060: ParseConversion — to-float rejects a non-numeric string.
# Companion to parse_conversion.llt-eval (which tests to-int).
# Note: E033 (FloatNotFinite) cannot be triggered via corpus tests — LLT has no float
# literals for NaN/infinity and no scientific notation. E033 is tested via unit tests
# in src/builtins.rs (floor_positive_infinity_errors, div_float_nan_result_is_error, etc.).
[to-float "not-a-float"]
=== error
to-float: cannot parse "not-a-float" as Float (defined at 5:1-5:25)
  in [to-float ...] at 5:1-5:25
